d_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-02-25T06:34:14Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T19:35:18Z","closed_at":"2026-03-04T20:35:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116749","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116749","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116749.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116749.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-04T20:35:15Z"},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1862\r\n\r\nPrepares for https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14319 in order to implement smoothing groups, I need this and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115926 merged first, so that would be it's own PR.\r\n\r\n# Added automatic smoothing to all CSG nodes through CSGShape3D\r\nIt works on individual meshes and also on children of `CSGCombiner3D`.\r\n\r\n- Tested with `CSGCombiner` `CSGBox`, `CSGCylinder`, `CSGTorus`, `CSGSphere`,`CSGPolygon3D` and `CSGMesh3D`.\r\n- Baking to mesh preserves normals.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"311\" height=\"126\" alt=\"inspector\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a4ff32e-5e46-474f-9ae0-1bb222b46a58\" />\r\n\r\n- `autosmooth` enables automatic smoothing. This overrides any smooth faces on the mesh, meaning it works on flat faced meshes like CSGBox\r\n<img width=\"372\" height=\"423\" alt=\"smooth_cube\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/58c29cf0-8e4f-4efd-8cc7-67e7d0dae382\" />\r\n\r\n- `smoothing_angle`: when comparing two faces of a mesh, if the angle is higher than this, the vertices are smoothed, otherwise they remain sharp.\r\nSetting this to a value lower than 0.1 skips the smoothing, which could lead to a performance increase.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1074\" height=\"650\" alt=\"auto_0\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1c8e325-ca91-43c7-a954-7b9bf61dd8d3\" />\r\n<img width=\"1108\" height=\"666\" alt=\"auto_30\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64cc16fc-3630-49e7-a8b3-b80112c94175\" />\r\n<img width=\"1106\" height=\"688\" alt=\"auto_50\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d69a07bf-4f8f-4008-8782-b771d3b8803a\" />\r\n<img width=\"1109\" height=\"680\" alt=\"auto_80\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abd73471-6c1f-4e26-bd98-99a4d730656e\" />\r\n<img width=\"857\" height=\"525\" alt=\"Captura de pantalla 2026-02-25 034110\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6547fb5f-4313-434e-87a9-64d1cefb5484\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n<img width=\"651\" height=\"579\" alt=\"Captura de pantalla 2026-02-27 095918\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a1de222-f862-4b89-9383-755943ea18b5\" />\r\n<img width=\"770\" height=\"618\" alt=\"Captura de pantalla 2026-02-27 100206\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2629df49-da1b-4b43-818d-3652d7b9bddb\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116749/reactions","total_count":22,"+1":13,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":7,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116749/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}